and her hiding places,

284
00:12:05,640 --> 00:12:07,500
no one knows them better than I do.

285
00:12:07,520 --> 00:12:08,640
As long as you

286
00:12:09,080 --> 00:12:10,480
are willing to let me out,

287
00:12:10,800 --> 00:12:12,260
I will definitely help you

288
00:12:12,920 --> 00:12:14,280
catch Fang Qingcheng

289
00:12:15,360 --> 00:12:16,820
to make up for my mistakes.

290
00:12:26,240 --> 00:12:27,000
Master.

291
00:12:28,240 --> 00:12:29,800
If you miss this chance,

292
00:12:30,560 --> 00:12:32,420
given Fang Qingcheng's cunning,

293
00:12:32,560 --> 00:12:33,960
trying to catch her again

294
00:12:35,000 --> 00:12:36,240
will be difficult.

295
00:12:41,120 --> 00:12:41,800
Master.

296
00:12:41,960 --> 00:12:43,800
I locked that prison cart myself.

297
00:12:43,800 --> 00:12:46,240
The one we escorted in was indeed the Young Madam.

298
00:12:46,240 --> 00:12:47,840
There is no way I saw it wrong.

299
00:12:48,680 --> 00:12:50,840
On the way to escorting the Young Madam,

300
00:12:50,840 --> 00:12:52,320
did anything unexpected happen?

301
00:12:52,320 --> 00:12:53,120
Unexpected?

302
00:12:56,160 --> 00:12:56,760
Oh, right.

303
00:12:57,040 --> 00:12:58,920
When we reached the Yaqian street intersection,

304
00:12:58,920 --> 00:13:01,850
the prison cart was blocked by a funeral procession.

305
00:13:03,160 --> 00:13:03,920
For how long?

306
00:13:05,880 --> 00:13:07,640
For half an incense stick's time.

307
00:13:07,640 --> 00:13:09,440
We were indeed delayed for a while.

308
00:13:09,440 --> 00:13:11,040
The funeral procession was playing music loudly

309
00:13:11,040 --> 00:13:12,360
and crying to the heavens.

310
00:13:12,360 --> 00:13:14,560
Everyone's attention was drawn to them,

311
00:13:14,560 --> 00:13:16,620
and we didn't notice the prison cart.

312
00:13:16,800 --> 00:13:18,460
When the prison cart arrived,

313
00:13:19,200 --> 00:13:21,600
did you see clearly the person getting off?

314
00:13:21,600 --> 00:13:22,860
What did she look like?

315
00:13:22,960 --> 00:13:24,600
It was already dark.

316
00:13:25,480 --> 00:13:26,600
Young Madam.

317
00:13:28,320 --> 00:13:29,200
That lady,

318
00:13:29,640 --> 00:13:32,080
when getting off the carriage, her hairpins were messy,

319
00:13:32,080 --> 00:13:33,880
and her face was covered by hair.

320
00:13:34,280 --> 00:13:35,120
I

321
00:13:36,320 --> 00:13:37,920
didn't see her face clearly.

322
00:13:40,000 --> 00:13:41,160
Forgive me, Young Master.

323
00:13:41,160 --> 00:13:42,360
It was my negligence.

324
00:13:46,360 --> 00:13:47,160
You also know,

325
00:13:48,200 --> 00:13:49,720
what my father values most

326
00:13:49,840 --> 00:13:52,370
is the reputation of the Governor's Mansion.

327
00:13:53,560 --> 00:13:54,320
So,

328
00:13:54,720 --> 00:13:57,280
please help suppress this, Adjutant.

329
00:13:57,680 --> 00:14:00,280
I will definitely investigate it thoroughly.

330
00:14:00,400 --> 00:14:02,330
Rest assured, Third Young Master.

331
00:14:02,680 --> 00:14:03,280
Then,

332
00:14:03,640 --> 00:14:05,500
what about the lady in the prison?

333
00:14:07,520 --> 00:14:08,400
Leave it to me.

334
00:14:08,520 --> 00:14:08,920
Yes.

335
00:14:22,640 --> 00:14:24,170
There is not even a scratch.

336
00:14:24,640 --> 00:14:25,920
How could they be swapped?
